      "created_at": "2016-05-05T18:52:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I played a random game today and for the first time recovered from the dreaded Sweat, Tears and Blinding Blast Opening. The clock was then already ticking for Fanatic (11), Greatest Legacy(9), Bunker(8), Ra(14) and Sky-Scraper(6). And even Rook City didn't deter our stalwart heroes (Neither Tony Taurus or Dr Tremalta came up).</p><p>This game saw a full Blood, Sweat and Tears, Assault Battery, Truth or Dare (Dare became Truth while Dawn was Flipped). The only seasonal villain to join the party was Summer while imbued Fire was in play. An epic game that. Only could have been more epic if I played it in advanced but that will be for another day...</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
